SUMMARY:Yolo Wine & Food Affair
DESCRIPTION:A unique opportunity to experience our Yolo County Wines wineries pouring their very best. Tickets are limited\, don’t miss out on this elevated evening. \nThe Yolo Wine & Food Affair is a celebration of the best of Yolo County’s food and wine. Join us on October 24th from 5:30-8 pm at Great Bear Vineyards in Davis. \nThe event will feature a dozen Yolo County wineries and their 90+ point wines\, Best of Class wines\, Double Gold wines\, and small-lot wines paired with small bites from local chefs. \nFor more info\, visit www.yolocountywines.com/winefoodaffair
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/yolo-wine-food-affair/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards 24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/VD-Great-Bear-Vineyards-270-1-scaled-YGPTQE.jpg
END:VEVENT
