CREATED:20251117T171126Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20251117T171126Z
UID:10013320-1792926000-1792951200@visityolo.com
SUMMARY:Sip Yolo with Yolo County Wines
DESCRIPTION:Discover the charm of Yolo County’s wine country this season by visiting our Yolo Wines wineries. From cozy tasting rooms to stunning vineyard views\, each tasting room offers award-winning wines\, hometown hospitality\, and wines perfect for gifting.  Gather your friends\, sip something new\, and make this season a little more delicious. \nVisit https://www.yolocountywines.com/events to see holiday winery events and to plan your wine trail! \n@berryessagapvineyards @collinadebella @elevationten @fjordoakwinery @greatbearvineyards @grindstonewines @heringerestates @juliettawinery @matchbookwines @sekahills @siltwineco @taberranch @turkovichwines  \n 
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/sip-yolo-with-yolo-county-wines/2026-10-25/
LOCATION:Yolo County Vineyard and Winery Association\, 13 winery locations!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/yolo-county-wines.jpeg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Visityolo Event": "https://visityolo.com/event/boheme-bewitched/2026-10-25/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:visityolo_event
X-SOURCE:Visityolo Event
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T183000
DTSTAMP:20261023T161842Z
CREATED:20261023T161842Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261023T161842Z
UID:10015323-1792926000-1792953000@visityolo.com
SUMMARY:Bohème Bewitched
DESCRIPTION:An enchanted interactive experience from Bohème in Davis\, the thrift boutique two blocks away. Quests through a glowing grove\, a blacklight zombie forest\, a frog bog\, a mermaid lagoon\, a witch’s cottage and a wood full of wisps. Spooky\, not scary. \nSix enchanted lands inside the old bank at 300 E Street\, downtown Davis: the old Union Bank building at the corner of 3rd and E\, next to Panera Bread\, one block from Central Park. \nHours: Wednesday to Friday 3:00 to 6:30pm. Saturday and Sunday 11:00am to 6:30pm. Closed Mondays and Tuesdays. Open 11am to 6:30pm on Saturday\, October 31. \n$4 at the door for the experience\, credited to any $8 purchase in the shop (same visit only). Open to all ages every day until 6:30pm. \nEnchanted Evenings: special evening events run 7 to 9:30pm on Oct 23\, 24 and 30. $13 online\, $15 at the door. \nEvery date\, hours and tickets: bohemebewitched.com
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/boheme-bewitched/2026-10-25/
LOCATION:Bohème Bewitched\, 300 E Street\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/bewitched-popup.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Visityolo Event": "https://visityolo.com/event/portraits-of-things-paintings-by-gioia-fonda-and-charlie-gill/2026-10-25/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:visityolo_event
X-SOURCE:Visityolo Event
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T170000
DTSTAMP:20260928T180906Z
CREATED:20260928T180906Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260928T180906Z
UID:10014926-1792927800-1792947600@visityolo.com
SUMMARY:Portraits of Things: Paintings by Gioia Fonda and Charlie Gill
DESCRIPTION:Portraits of Things: Paintings by Gioia Fonda and Charlie Gill at Pence Gallery in Davis \nExhibit: October 9 – November 29\, 2026 \nReception: Friday\, October 9\, 6-9 PM (Free) \nArtist Talk: Sunday\, November 8\, 2-3:30 PM (Free) \n  \nInterdisciplinary artist Gioia Fonda has long collected colorful toys\, both for their intrinsic charm and as creative inspiration. As a student at California College of the Arts\, she arranged small collectibles into still-life compositions\, captured them on film\, and processed the photos at a local drugstore. Captivated by these arrangements\, her advisor\, Charlie Gill\, painted spare compositions based on her photographs—works that now hang alongside hers. For this exhibition\, Fonda has created a series of new paintings featuring similar arrangements of toys and found objects. She is also offering an opportunity for members of the public to exhibit their own small works on paper\, riffing on some of her recent photos. Artists may add to this display throughout the duration of the show.  \n  \nSponsored by the Pence Community Curatorial Fund. \n  \nImage: Gioia Fonda\, “Holding It Together”
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/portraits-of-things-paintings-by-gioia-fonda-and-charlie-gill/2026-10-25/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Gioia-Fonda-Holding-It-Together-copy.jpeg
