X-SOURCE:Meetup Mindful Embodied Spirituality
UID:event_317054607@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261024T020438Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261110T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261110T200000
SUMMARY:Let's talk about Female Sexuality & Fluidity
DESCRIPTION:Iama Embodied Community\nIf you have ever questioned your sexu
 ality\, experienced unexpected attraction\, fallen for someone who challen
 ged how you understood your sexual identity\, or simply wondered why we do
 n’t talk more openly about women’s sexuality\, this event is for you.\
 n\nI thought I was heterosexual until I fell in love with a woman. Reading
  Sexual Fluidity by Lisa Diamond has helped me make sense of my experience
 \, and it made me realize how many women might be navigating similar quest
 ions without having a safe space to talk about them.\n\nCome join us in a 
 frank\, open conversation and connect with other women with similar experi
 ences. Let's talk about sexual fluidity and unexpected attraction\, questi
 oning or rethinking the labels we’ve used to understand ourselves\, dati
 ng patterns\, desire\, and the ways our experiences of attraction may chan
 ge\, sexual shame\, social expectations\, and the messages we’ve inherit
 ed about sexuality\, gender\, identity\, and giving ourselves permission t
 o explore without needing all the answers (and labels)\, what else is on Y
 OUR mind??\n\nWe’ll meet at Betty on T\, they have coffee\, tea\, wine\,
  and food options. Depending on our group size and the weather we’ll fin
 d a spot indoors or on the heated patio. I’ll have a sign on our table. 
 Please RSVP to help with the reservation.\n\nIf you know a woman who might
  appreciate this kind of space\, please share the event with her. You neve
 r know who might be looking for this conversation.\n\n**About the hostess*
 *\n\nI’m Rola (pronounced Ru-lah)\, I am a pastor\, yoga instructor\, so
 matic guide\, and trauma-informed facilitator currently working toward bec
 oming a somatic coach. I bring experience in group facilitation\, integrat
 ive somatic trauma therapy\, embodiment\, and a deep curiosity about the w
 ays we experience ourselves and relate to one another.\n\n**P.S.**\n\n* Th
 is isn’t a formal workshop or a lecture. I’ll bring a few prompts to g
 et the conversation started\, but my hope is that it unfolds organically\,
  shaped who shows up and what we feel moved to share\n* There is no pressu
 re to disclose anything personal\, you are welcome to share\, ask question
 s\, or simply listen or be present\n* You don’t need to be questioning y
 our sexuality or have a particular identity to join. Even if you’re just
  curious about female sexuality and how it unfolds\, you are welcome\n* Th
 is space is for female-bodied individuals
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/mindful-embodied-spirituality/events/
 317054607/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261019T232229Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261019T232229Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
